-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §126 המרת שכר: a young-division head who goes
-- on as one is converted as a second deputy (§120); one who does not, "in
-- accordance with section — above", a trailing management allowance in X.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-common`
IMPORT `base-agreement-44`
IMPORT `base-agreement-120`
§ `126 המרת שכר`

DECLARE `conversion of a young-division head` IS ONE OF `a second deputy's (§120)`, `a teacher's (§44)`

-- (א): going on as head, §120. (ב): "בהתאם להוראות סעיף לעיל" — the
-- section's number is missing (F-ofek-hadash-base-126-a). The reading
-- adopted (convention reading.misprint): a teacher's conversion, §44, as
-- for any teacher no longer in a post, the trailing management allowance in
-- X (as §44(ב)(2) has it too).
@ref akn:art_126__para_a akn:art_126__para_b
GIVEN `goes on as young-division head` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `conversion of a young-division head`
DECIDE `how a young-division head is converted` `goes on as young-division head` IS
    IF `goes on as young-division head` THEN `a second deputy's (§120)` ELSE `a teacher's (§44)`

`the section number 126(ב) prints` MEANS ""
`126(ב) names no section` MEANS `the section number 126(ב) prints` EQUALS ""
#ASSERT `126(ב) names no section`
#ASSERT `in the salary to convert` `a trailing management or counselling allowance`
